Each of the six slots now also logs DR level (stun, fear, incapacitate,
silence), CC time left and whether its interrupt, main CC and main
defensive cooldown are ready (decision log tag v4). FeaturesFor() feeds
151-input nets the old v2 vector and 199-input nets the new one, so the
running nets keep working and a v4 net can be hot-loaded later.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vn4vD1fiBmsMGCCvsiqU7z
